Aichi-Nagoya 2026 — All 43 Sports (EN-JP version) — Pictogram Motion (Lemo-Opuscar demo)
LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5   (credit line on the end card, 157.4–161.6 s)

Imagery
- All pictures are generated by code in this folder (Canvas2D: engine.js, scenes.js, poses/*.js). No photos,
  no AI-generated images, no stock footage.
- The pictogram athletes (70 poses), pattern motifs, layouts and transitions were written for this film.

